    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fragment of Us: Encounter the Quirky Her</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of a sweet campus romance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragment of Us</strong> takes you into a Japanese campus filled with cherry blossoms, where you\u2019ll meet the quirky and charming high school girl\u2014<strong>Nakano Aoi</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nakano Aoi</strong> is a lively and curious girl with smooth silver hair and sparkling blue eyes that always gleam with mischief. She loves trying new things and often comes up with whimsical ideas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of Exquisite Images:</strong> From cherry blossom-filled campuses to romantic date spots, hundreds of beautifully crafted images present the most picturesque romantic scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Couple Dialogues:</strong> Each scene comes with carefully designed dialogues, making you feel as if you\u2019re truly there, experiencing sweet interactions with Nakano Aoi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Puzzle Gameplay:</strong> Complete puzzles to unlock more stunning images and hidden storylines, gradually uncovering little secrets between you and Nakano Aoi!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go on a Date with Her:</strong> Receive an unpredictable invitation from Nakano Aoi and embark on your romantic journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Puzzles:</strong> Drag and place the fragments to complete the picture, unlocking exclusive memories with Nakano Aoi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the Story:</strong> After completing the puzzles, admire the beautiful images and sweet dialogues, immersing yourself in the beauty of romance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to start an unforgettable romantic journey with Nakano Aoi?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Fragment of Us awaits your challenge!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
